{"title":"2021 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Memorizing_Roots)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Memorizing Roots)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(EASY_TO_UNDERSTAND📈)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (EASY TO UNDERSTAND📈)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Mathematical_Dexterity_(50_Seconds)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Mathematical Dexterity (50 Seconds)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/4/5749240ae8ece37286353b405294a42d7bf59b93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\left(3-2\\sqrt{3}\\right)^2}+\\sqrt{\\left(3+2\\sqrt{3}\\right)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"244\" height=\"43\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/3/5931df459e2de0a4c51ac5a16e12c2167a1f9cc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} ~0 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)} ~4\\sqrt{3}-6 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)} ~6 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)} ~4\\sqrt{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)} ~4\\sqrt{3}+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"484\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that the square root of any number squared is always the absolute value of the squared number because the square root function will only return a nonnegative number. By squaring both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e455d80f4657b1112ba302a6e2c42e9c81f780ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561146df4277ef4e3cdc3642c66647dd77fb0211.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{3}&gt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/408afe47a1bfd5cfa800163b3633d975cb4bf1e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> is negative, so we must take the absolute value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/408afe47a1bfd5cfa800163b3633d975cb4bf1e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />, which is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d794dfbb408fd64b08677e7eaf117c58329ee697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{3}-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />. Knowing this, the first term in the expression equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d794dfbb408fd64b08677e7eaf117c58329ee697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{3}-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" /> and the second term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/9/849204982895b188d8926173e1872f158faf78df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+2\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"21\" />, and summing the two gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/d/22d6380b54b9ca757b8bc5c0dc2d98800d4d86b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~4\\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"80\" height=\"33\" />. \n</p><p>~bjc, abhinavg67 and JackBocresion\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/2/402d0d9eadd46d5d1c461697eda94c382cbd2b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sqrt{(3-2\\sqrt{3})^2}+\\sqrt{(3+2\\sqrt{3})^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"265\" height=\"32\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/3/e933add296bb005d5a0ded8a70f7b1db22341953.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = (3-2\\sqrt{3})^2+2\\sqrt{(-3)^2}+(3+2\\sqrt3)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"329\" height=\"32\" />. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/f/60fd4df13b65457e9a2912b281a9992c4cb03d26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{(-3)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"72\" height=\"32\" /> term is there due to difference of squares when you simplify <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/6/c86e802b02490888501a6d8ef3e6836615e2129a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/1/f613327478b9be645ed8ce93b117b0464d4e2c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + b)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"19\" />. Simplifying the expression gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8ad0a3b73b0a508089e2761f88c4784aafe90f3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/0/ab02bd1cdecb13ba0ad701b64de277245a02b9d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~4\\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"116\" height=\"35\" /> ~ shrungpatel\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Memorizing_Roots.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Memorizing_Roots)\">Solution 3 (Memorizing Roots)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Memorizing Roots)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Memorizing your square roots from 1 - 10 are really important for cheesing some AMC problems, so try to memorize them.\n</p><p>\\( \\sqrt{3} \\) is about 1.7.\n</p><p>We then substitute \\( \\sqrt{3} \\) for 1.7 to solve this.\n</p><p>We get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d53fdecc00161231f7130f8c71fe94497648df5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{(3-2 \\cdot 1.7)^2} + \\sqrt{(3+2 \\cdot 1.7)^2}\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e8eebbbc9a8852d1b0a7eecb9f52fa86b05b8f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\sqrt{(-0.4)^2} + \\sqrt{(6.4)^2}\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/1/2413544acdf0909f6d93c51bb3e710eeaf65e911.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\sqrt{0.16} + \\sqrt{6.4^2}\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acce90e2c132324f21babe9fd0f68cad20250ee8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 0.4 + 6.4\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/2/2f22619805430e3bc6bc130a028a33fa8b16658f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 6.8\\]\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Looking at the answer choices, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/d/22d6380b54b9ca757b8bc5c0dc2d98800d4d86b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~4\\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"80\" height=\"33\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d548dba09dd4b1c978f60cd8e4e08a826bb4c29b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.8$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> for when \\( \\sqrt{3} = 1.7 \\).\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HHVdPTLQsLc\">https://youtu.be/HHVdPTLQsLc</a>\n~Math Python\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28EASY_TO_UNDERSTAND.F0.9F.93.88.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(EASY_TO_UNDERSTAND📈)\">Video Solution (EASY TO UNDERSTAND📈)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (EASY TO UNDERSTAND📈)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A1Li_jciTZY\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A1Li_jciTZY</a>\n</p><p>~CalculaCore\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Df3AIGD78xM\">https://youtu.be/Df3AIGD78xM</a>\n</p><p>~pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/v71C6cFbErQ\">https://youtu.be/v71C6cFbErQ</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gLahuINjRzU?t=154\">https://youtu.be/gLahuINjRzU?t=154</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DvpN56Ob6Zw?t=1\">https://youtu.be/DvpN56Ob6Zw?t=1</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Mathematical_Dexterity_.2850_Seconds.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Mathematical_Dexterity_(50_Seconds)\">Video Solution by Mathematical Dexterity (50 Seconds)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Mathematical Dexterity (50 Seconds)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ScZ5VK7QTpY\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ScZ5VK7QTpY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3GHD62FK0xY\">https://youtu.be/3GHD62FK0xY</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B\" title=\"2021 AMC 10B\">2021 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2021 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resource